Reflection (Week 5)
This week demonstrated the value of layered security controls and automated monitoring. AppArmor enforces access restrictions, fail2ban protects against brute-force attacks, and unattended upgrades reduce exposure to vulnerabilities. Creating scripts not only automates verification but also ensures repeatable and auditable administration.
Remote monitoring prepares the groundwork for performance evaluation in Week 6, making system behavior transparent under different workloads.
